<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta http-equiv='Content-Type' content='text/html; charset=utf-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>Verification Code — National Address Platform</title>
    <style>
      body { background-color: #F5F6F7; color: #234361; font-family: "SF UI
      Text", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica,
      Arial, sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Segoe UI
      Symbol"; margin: auto; padding: 25px; } a { text-decoration: none; }
      .pin-code { font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 8px;
      color: #003b80; text-align: center; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0;
      background-color: #f0f4f8; border-radius: 8px; font-family: monospace; }
      .container { background-color: #ebeff3; padding: 25px; border-radius: 4px; }
      .title { align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #E4E7EB;
      justify-content: center; margin-top: 35px; min-height: 6em; padding: 10px;
      text-align: center; } .warning { color: #735c0f; background-color:
      #fffbdd; padding: 12px; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 16px; font-size:
      14px; } img { max-height: 45px; background-color: #F5F6F7; }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div>
      <img
        src='{{apiUrl}}/public/images/logo-adresse.png'
        alt='National Address Platform Logo'
      />
    </div>
    <div class='title'>
      <h2 style='margin:0; mso-line-height-rule:exactly;'>Verification Code</h2>
      <p>Use the code below to authorize your Local Address Base</p>
    </div>

    <div class='container'>
      <p>Your verification code is:</p>

      <div class='pin-code'>{{pinCode}}</div>

      <p>Enter this code in the National Address Platform editor to verify your
        jurisdiction authority and authorize your Local Address Base for
        publication.</p>

      <div class='warning'>
        This code expires in <b>{{expirationMinutes}} minutes</b>. If the code
        expires, you can request a new one from the editor.
      </div>

      <p style='margin-top: 20px;'>If you did not request this code, you can
        safely ignore this email.</p>

      <br />
      <span><i>The National Address Platform Team</i></span>
    </div>
  </body>

</html>
